# Text files keep LF line endings in every checkout, Windows included: the tests compare
# server.properties and generated sources byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.ldb binary
*.mcpack binary
